{"meta":{"id":"openssh","category":"it/server/infra/home-server","title":"4. OpenSSH — 키 로그인 · 차단","subtitle":"","summary":"작업용 / 관리자 계정 분리(관리자는 집 랜만), ed25519 키 + passphrase, 비밀번호 · root 로그인 차단(01-hardening.conf), fail2ban","tags":["ubuntu","리눅스","서버","홈서버","ssh","보안","fail2ban"],"color":"indigo","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-indigo","source":"ubunto_start","updatedAt":"2026-11-01"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-indigo-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 border border-indigo-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></span>SSH</span>\r\n<span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-stone-400 font-serif\">2026-11-01</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">4. OpenSSH — 키 로그인 · 차단</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-indigo-50/70 border border-indigo-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> 작업용 / 관리자 계정 분리(관리자는 집 랜만), ed25519 키 + passphrase, 비밀번호 · root 로그인 차단(01-hardening.conf), fail2ban</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">계정 구성</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">계정</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">용도</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">집 랜 (192.168.0.x)</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">VPN (10.0.0.x)</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>devuser</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">SSH 접속용 (평소 작업)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">✅ 키로만</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">✅ 키로만</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>adminuser</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">관리자 (sudo)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">✅ 키 + passphrase</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">❌ 차단</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>root</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">직접 로그인 안 함</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">❌</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">❌</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">• 평소 작업과 관리자 권한을 분리 — <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>devuser</code> 에는 sudo 가 없다<br>• <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>lxd</code> 그룹은 컨테이너로 서버 디스크 전체를 마운트할 수 있어 <strong class='text-stone-900'>사실상 root 권한</strong> → LXD 를 안 쓰므로 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>sudo gpasswd -d devuser lxd</code> 로 제거<br>• 밖에서 관리가 꼭 필요하면 VPN 으로 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>devuser</code> 접속 후 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>su - adminuser</code></p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">설치 · 상태 확인</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">설치 화면에서 OpenSSH 를 체크해 이미 설치돼 있었습니다. <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>systemctl status ssh</code> 가 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>disabled</code> 로 보여도 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>TriggeredBy: ssh.socket</code> 이면 정상입니다 — 최신 Ubuntu 는 접속이 올 때 소켓이 SSH 를 띄웁니다.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">SSH 키 로그인</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">개념</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">설명</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">개인키</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">열쇠. 윈도우에만 보관, 절대 공유 금지</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">공개키</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">자물쇠. 서버 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>~/.ssh/authorized_keys</code> 에 등록</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">passphrase</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">키 파일에 거는 비밀번호. 서버로 가지 않고 윈도우에서 키를 열 때만 씀 — 키 파일을 도난당해도 못 쓰게. 키 파일 단위라 계정마다 다르게 하려면 키를 따로 만든다</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">키 파일 (윈도우 ~/.ssh)</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">passphrase</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">등록 계정</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>id_ed25519</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">없음</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>devuser</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>id_ed25519_admin</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>있음</strong></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>adminuser</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">휴대폰 ConnectBot 앱 키</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">앱 설정</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>devuser</code> — VPN 경유 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>devuser@10.0.0.1</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">powershell</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\"># 윈도우 PowerShell\r\nssh-keygen -t ed25519 -C &quot;pc-key&quot;                                              # devuser 용, passphrase 없음\r\nssh-keygen -t ed25519 -C &quot;pc-admin-key&quot; -f $env:USERPROFILE\\.ssh\\id_ed25519_admin   # adminuser 용, passphrase 입력\r\n\r\n# 공개키 등록 (윈도우엔 ssh-copy-id 가 없어서 한 줄로)\r\ntype $env:USERPROFILE\\.ssh\\id_ed25519.pub | ssh devuser@192.168.0.10 &quot;mkdir -p ~/.ssh &amp;&amp; chmod 700 ~/.ssh &amp;&amp; cat &gt;&gt; ~/.ssh/authorized_keys &amp;&amp; chmod 600 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys&quot;</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">윈도우 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>%USERPROFILE%\\.ssh\\config</code> 에 접속 별칭과 계정별 키를 지정합니다 (메모장으로 만들 땐 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>config.txt</code> 가 되지 않게). <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>IdentitiesOnly yes</code> 는 지정한 키만 쓰게 합니다.</p><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">ssh config</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">Host homeserver\r\n    HostName 192.168.0.10\r\n    User devuser\r\n    IdentityFile ~/.ssh/id_ed25519\r\n    IdentitiesOnly yes\r\n\r\nHost homeserver-admin\r\n    HostName 192.168.0.10\r\n    User adminuser\r\n    IdentityFile ~/.ssh/id_ed25519_admin\r\n    IdentitiesOnly yes</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">• passphrase 추가 · 변경은 키를 새로 만들 필요 없이 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>ssh-keygen -p -f <키 파일></code> (서버 재등록 불필요)<br>• 키 삭제는 <strong class='text-stone-900'>서버 authorized_keys 먼저</strong>, 윈도우 키 파일은 나중에 — 순서가 바뀌면 SSH 로 못 들어간다<br>• 서버 계정 비밀번호를 바꿔도 키 로그인엔 영향 없음 (sudo · su · 콘솔 로그인에만 쓰임)</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">비밀번호 로그인 차단</h2><span class=\"ml-auto text-[11px] text-stone-400 font-medium\">✅ 적용</span></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">두 계정 모두 키 로그인이 되는 걸 확인한 뒤, 기존 SSH 창은 열어 둔 채로 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>/etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/01-hardening.conf</code> 를 만들었습니다.</p><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">sshd</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">PasswordAuthentication no\r\nKbdInteractiveAuthentication no\r\nPermitRootLogin no\r\nPubkeyAuthentication yes\r\nAllowUsers devuser adminuser@192.168.0.0/24</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">• <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>AllowUsers devuser adminuser@192.168.0.0/24</code> — <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>devuser</code> 는 어디서든, <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>adminuser</code> 은 <strong class='text-stone-900'>접속해 오는 IP 가 집 랜일 때만</strong>. 목록에 없는 계정은 전부 거부<br>• 파일 이름을 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>01-</code> 로 시작한 이유 — sshd 는 같은 설정이 여러 번 나오면 <strong class='text-stone-900'>먼저 읽은 값</strong>을 쓰는데, 같은 폴더의 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>50-cloud-init.conf</code> 에 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>PasswordAuthentication yes</code> 가 있을 수 있다</p><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">bash</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">sudo sshd -t &amp;&amp; sudo systemctl restart ssh      # 문법 확인 → 적용\r\nsudo sshd -T | grep -Ei &#x27;passwordauthentication|permitrootlogin|allowusers&#x27;\r\n\r\n# 윈도우 새 PowerShell 창에서\r\nssh homeserver     # 성공\r\nssh homeserver-admin      # passphrase 입력 후 성공\r\nssh -o PubkeyAuthentication=no -o PreferredAuthentications=password devuser@192.168.0.10   # Permission denied (publickey) 가 정상</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">fail2ban</h2><span class=\"ml-auto text-[11px] text-stone-400 font-medium\">✅ 적용</span></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>/etc/fail2ban/jail.local</code> — 10분 안에 5번 실패하면 1시간 차단합니다. 적용은 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>sudo systemctl enable --now fail2ban</code>.</p><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">ini</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">[DEFAULT]\r\nbantime  = 1h\r\nfindtime = 10m\r\nmaxretry = 5\r\nignoreip = 127.0.0.1/8 192.168.0.0/24\r\n\r\n[sshd]\r\nenabled = true\r\nbackend = systemd</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">• 차단 예외는 <strong class='text-stone-900'>집 랜만</strong>. VPN 대역(<code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>10.0.0.0/24</code>)은 넣지 않는다 — VPN 키가 유출된 경우를 대비해 외부와 똑같이 취급<br>• 키 로그인은 틀릴 일이 거의 없고 passphrase 오입력은 윈도우 안에서 끝나 서버 실패 횟수에 안 들어가서, 나 자신이 막힐 위험은 낮다<br>• 상태 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>sudo fail2ban-client status sshd</code>, 차단 해제 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>sudo fail2ban-client set sshd unbanip <IP></code></p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">트러블슈팅</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">증상</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">확인할 것</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>Connection refused</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">서버 IP(<code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>127.0.0.1</code> 은 윈도우 자신), <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>systemctl status ssh</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>ss -tlnp | grep :22</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>Connection timed out</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">같은 공유기인지, <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>ufw status</code>, 서버 IP 가 바뀌지 않았는지</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">키 등록했는데 비밀번호를 물음</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">서버 권한 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>chmod 700 ~/.ssh</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>chmod 600 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys</code> / <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>ssh -v</code> 로 키를 보내는지</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>REMOTE HOST IDENTIFICATION HAS CHANGED</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">서버 재설치 후 — 윈도우에서 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>ssh-keygen -R 192.168.0.10</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">거부 이유 확인</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">서버 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>journalctl -u ssh -e</code> → <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>not allowed because not listed in AllowUsers</code> 등</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n","path":"it/server/infra/home-server/openssh","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"server","title":"서버","path":"it/server"},{"id":"infra","title":"인프라","path":"it/server/infra"},{"id":"home-server","title":"홈 서버 (Ubuntu)","path":"it/server/infra/home-server"}],"hasImage":false}